+        // [Core vendored patch - D restart deadlock] The host marks a wrapped VST3 instance as crashed
+        // so JUCE's internal restart path can skip it. A crash inside processBlock is caught by the host's
+        // SEH handler, which runs no C++ destructors (/EHsc), leaving the wrapper's processMutex held
